  "notes": "{超|こ}える means to exceed, surpass, or go beyond a limit.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle for what is exceeded\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {超|こ}える: to exceed, surpass (abstract limits)\n- ⟦{越|こ}える→越える：02099_koeru⟧: to cross over, pass (physical boundaries)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{予算|よさん}→予算：03663_yosan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{超|こ}える: to exceed the budget\n- ⟦{限界|げんかい}→限界：02715_genkai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{超|こ}える: to exceed limits\n- ⟦{想像|そうぞう}→想像：02489_souzou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{超|こ}える: beyond imagination\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{超|こ}えた: beyond ~, transcending ~\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n{超|ちょう}〜 is a prefix meaning \"super\" or \"ultra\" (e.g., {超|ちょう}⟦{高速|こうそく}→高速：02749_kousoku⟧ = ultra-high-speed)",
